{title: Ye Zameen Gaa Rahi Hai}
{artist: Amit Kumar R D Burman}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E] [A] [E] [A],        Yeh zameen ga rahi hai aasman ga raha hai
[D] [E],        Saath mere yeh sara, jahan ga raha hai
[A] [D] [E]
Shaukh kaliyo ke ghunghat sarkane lage hai
[A] [D] [E],        Mast phulo ke dil bhee dhadakane lage hai
[E] [A] [E] [A],        Yeh baharo kaa dilkash sama ga raha hai
[D] [E],        Saath mere yeh sara, jahan ga raha hai
[A] [D] [E],        Jhumkar parbato pe ghata chha rahee hai
[A] [D] [E],        Pyaar ki umar shayad karib aa rahee hai
[E] [A] [E] [A],        Mera dil pyaar ki yeh dastaan ga raha hai
[D] [E],        Saath mere ye sara, jahan ga raha hai
[A] [D] [E],        Bhul kar raah koyee hasin aa na jaye
[A] [D] [E],        Iss jagah koyee paradanashi aa na jaye
[E] [A] [E],        Iss jagah aaj ek naujawan ga raha hai
[D] [E],        Saath mere yeh sara, jahan ga raha hai
